description	"Freyyr

A large wookie leader returned from the depths of the shadowlands.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- Freyyr's Warblade (Purple/Red)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 70% more Kb
-- 33% more Reach
- Traditional Bowcaster (1)
- Thermal Grenades (3)

^8Attributes:
- 10% faster Skill Cd
- Strength (2)
- Fury (3)
-- 10% slower Resource Decay
- Blast Armor
- Rally

^3Abilities:
- Command (Resource/Block Dispenser 3) ^3[Use Key In Melee]
